{"id": "dst_gap_one_shot", "input": "Set a one-time reminder for 2:30am on 14 March 2027 to check the server after the time change.", "intent": "clarify", "expected_tools": [], "allowed_tools": ["current_time"], "tags": ["scheduling", "one_shot", "dst"], "forbidden_tools": ["notify_me"], "rubric": "2:30am on 14 March 2027 does not exist in Toronto (clocks jump 2:00 EST to 3:00 EDT). A good run says so and asks which real time to use (03:30 EDT, 03:00 EDT or 01:30 EST) rather than silently picking one.", "metadata": {"curation": "Relabelled 2026-11-18 from a one-shot proposal to clarify: for a nonexistent local time, asking is at least as correct as choosing, and the original draft said not to create it silently."}}
